# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_URL / STOCK_SCANNER_MCP_URL are no longer read from here -- both third-party
# MCP servers are self-hosted by docker-compose.yaml's tradingview-mcp / stock-scanner-mcp
# services (stdio-only servers bridged to SSE via mcp-proxy) and the scheduler service points
# at them directly, since neither has a free, ready-to-use hosted HTTP endpoint to configure
# here instead.
